\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. I am trusting Thee, Lord Jesus,
\par Trusting only Thee;
\par Trusting Thee for full salvation,
\par Great and free.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. I am trusting Thee for pardon,
\par At Thy feet I bow;
\par For Thy grace and tender mercy,
\par Trusting now.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. I am trusting Thee for cleansing
\par In the crimson flood;
\par Trusting Thee to make me holy
\par By Thy blood.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. I am trusting Thee to guide me;
\par Thou alone shall lead,
\par Every day and hour supplying
\par All my need.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. I am Trusting thee for power,
\par Thine can never fail;
\par Words which Thou Thyself shalt give me
\par Must prevail.\tab\tab 
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. I am trusting Thee, Lord Jesus;
\par Never let me fall;
\par I am trusting Thee for ever,
\par And for all.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

